    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal Percolator-style primary-lock registry. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks which txn_id holds the primary lock on each key and when it expires. A new transaction may steal an expired lock via <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1fi__test_1_1_percolator_lock_registry_1a884c308997aa89c7ffc5e948b2098f80" kindref="member">cleanAndAcquire()</ref>. </para>
